                "content": "Predatory pricing? No, that's market demand and brand desirability. Nike creates iconic products that people *want*, and that drives value. 'Hype-driven greed' is just a dismissive term for genuine cultural influence and industry leadership. Adidas is just playing catch-up, always. #NikeIsKing #AirMaxCulture",
